title: "ZERUM — A Computação Antes da Execução"
authors:
  - name: "AUŠRA Quantinum"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SerenaSolutions/zerum"
abstract: >-
  Certified necessity compiler: answers questions about computations before
  running them. SIFR language, SCA elimination ladder, trivalent logic with
  the numeral Z (zerum), independent verification. 0 wrong answers in 500,000
  randomized problems; 500,000/500000 certificates verified; 20/20 forged
  certificates rejected; 76.5% of demanded computation units eliminated.
keywords:
  - certified computation
  - domain-specific language
  - partial evaluation
  - interval arithmetic
  - proof-carrying certificates
  - trivalent logic
  - computation avoidance
